{"id":"A2-L003","title":"Key verb: get (past and decisions)","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U01","focus":"Verbo-chave: get","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: get","pron":"Schwa /ə/","verbs":["decide"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["terminal","view","baggage claim","reservation","single room","double room","key card","room service","breakfast buffet","sightseeing","guided tour","guidebook","postcard","beach resort","tent","exchange rate"],"field":"Viagens","genre":"Blog, diário, crônica","skill":"Fala","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 3 · Key verb: get (past and decisions)","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: get.","**Verbos:** decide.","**Pronúncia:** Schwa /ə/.","**10 palavras novas** (viagens).","**Texto do dia:** blog, diário, crônica."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar get no passado e decidir com decide em um blog de viagem."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["terminal","terminal"],["view","vista"],["baggage claim","retirada de bagagem"],["reservation","reserva"],["single room","quarto individual"],["double room","double room"],["key card","key card"],["room service","room service"],["breakfast buffet","breakfast buffet"],["sightseeing","sightseeing"],["guided tour","guided tour"],["guidebook","guidebook"],["postcard","postcard"],["beach resort","beach resort"],["tent","tent"],["exchange rate","exchange rate"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A travel blog","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"How I Got to Lisbon","paras":["I **got** a cheap flight last winter. After I **got** to the airport, I **got** lost in the terminal. A kind clerk **got** me a map, and I **got** on the right bus.","At the hotel I **got** a room with a river view. I **decided** to stay a week. Best decision ever!"],"kicker":"TRAVEL BLOG","by":"Nina","gloss":[["terminal","terminal"],["river view","vista do rio"],["flight","voo"],["lost","perdido"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Nina got a cheap flight.","ans":"T","why":"“cheap flight.”"},{"q":"She stayed one night.","ans":"F","why":"a week."},{"q":"A clerk gave her a map.","ans":"T","why":"“got me a map.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“flight” means…","opts":["voo","vagão","escala"],"ans":0,"why":"flight."},{"q":"“lost” means…","opts":["perdido","cansado","atrasado"],"ans":0,"why":"lost."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"get: sentidos no passado","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Presente","Passado (got)","Exemplo"],"rows":[["get = obter","**got**","**I got a ticket.**"],["get = chegar","**got to**","**We got to the hotel.**"],["get = ficar","**got tired**","**She got tired.**"],["get lost","**got lost**","**I got lost.**"]],"cap":"get: sentidos no passado"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Passado de get: **got** (EUA: particípio **gotten**)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ a cheap flight. (get)","a":"got","why":"passado."},{"s":"We ___ to the hotel at six. (get)","a":"got","why":"chegar."},{"s":"He ___ lost. (get)","a":"got","why":"get lost."},{"s":"She ___ to stay a week. (decide)","a":"decided","why":"+d."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["flight","voo"],["terminal","terminal"],["view","vista"],["delay","atraso"],["baggage claim","retirada de bagagem"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["I","got","it","online","Yes"],"ans":"Yes I got it online","pt":"Sim, peguei online."},{"words":["time","Good","You're","in"],"ans":"Good You're in time","pt":"Ótimo. Você está no horário."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"terminal","pos":"word","pt":"terminal","ex":"The bus terminal.","expt":"O terminal de ônibus."},{"w":"view","pos":"word","pt":"vista","ex":"A river view.","expt":"Uma vista do rio."},{"w":"baggage claim","pos":"word","pt":"retirada de bagagem","ex":"Wait at baggage claim.","expt":"Espere na retirada de bagagem."},{"w":"reservation","pos":"word","pt":"reserva","ex":"I have a reservation.","expt":"Tenho uma reserva."},{"w":"single room","pos":"word","pt":"quarto individual","ex":"A single room.","expt":"Um quarto individual."},{"w":"double room","pos":"word","pt":"double room","ex":"quarto de casal","expt":"A double room."},{"w":"key card","pos":"word","pt":"key card","ex":"cartão-chave","expt":"Use your key card."},{"w":"room service","pos":"word","pt":"room service","ex":"serviço de quarto","expt":"Order room service."},{"w":"breakfast buffet","pos":"word","pt":"breakfast buffet","ex":"buffet de café","expt":"A big breakfast buffet."},{"w":"sightseeing","pos":"word","pt":"sightseeing","ex":"turismo","expt":"Go sightseeing."},{"w":"guided tour","pos":"word","pt":"guided tour","ex":"visita guiada","expt":"Join a guided tour."},{"w":"guidebook","pos":"word","pt":"guidebook","ex":"guia de viagem","expt":"Buy a guidebook."},{"w":"postcard","pos":"word","pt":"postcard","ex":"cartão-postal","expt":"Send a postcard."},{"w":"beach resort","pos":"word","pt":"beach resort","ex":"resort de praia","expt":"A beach resort."},{"w":"tent","pos":"word","pt":"tent","ex":"barraca","expt":"A small tent."},{"w":"exchange rate","pos":"word","pt":"exchange rate","ex":"taxa de câmbio","expt":"A good exchange rate."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Excuse me, where is gate five?** — Com licença, onde fica o por